Page Name: Member Portal — During Event
Slug: member-portal-during

What it is: The logged-in member's live hub for the weekend of their Landmark Forum ("Your Forum — Live"). A tabbed page (Current Program / All Programs) with the join link, daily assignments, graduation invites, the full program map, FAQ, and support.

Who it is visible to: Enrolled Forum participants, signed in to the Member Portal, during their event window.

When someone accesses it: From the day the Forum begins through graduation — as the day-of home base for joining sessions and finding what's next.

Purpose: Give participants one clear place for everything the weekend needs — how to join, what to do each day, who to invite to graduation, where the curriculum goes next, and how to reach support.
